<figure class="quorum" data-r44-quorum aria-labelledby="r44-quorum-title">
 <figcaption id="r44-quorum-title"><span>Figure 2</span> A range needs agreement, even with a leaseholder</figcaption>
 <div class="controls"><label>Unreachable followers <select data-out><option value="0">None · A, B and C reachable</option><option value="1">One · C unreachable</option><option value="2">Two · B and C unreachable</option></select></label></div>
 <div class="scene"><p class="gateway">SQL gateway <span aria-hidden="true">→</span> A · range leaseholder</p><div class="replicas">
 {['A','B','C'].map((name,i)=><section data-replica={i}><p class="panel-title">{name}{i===0?' · leader':''}</p><p data-replica-status>Waiting</p><div class="log" data-log>Earlier log</div></section>)}
 </div><p class="count" data-count data-live>0 of 3 votes</p><p data-result data-live>Command not yet proposed</p></div>
 <p data-explanation data-live aria-live="polite">The gateway has located the range. A has its lease; B and C hold voting copies of the same range.</p>
 <div class="playback"><button type="button" data-play>Play</button><button type="button" data-back>Back</button><button type="button" data-next>Next</button><span data-step></span><button type="button" data-reset>Reset</button></div><div data-hold aria-hidden="true"><span></span></div>
 <details><summary>Read the command as text</summary><ol><li>The gateway routes the request to A, the range leaseholder.</li><li>A proposes a range command and sends it to voting followers.</li><li>Reachable replicas persist the proposal. Two of the three voters are needed.</li><li>With a majority the range command can commit. With only A reachable, the command cannot commit through Raft.</li></ol></details>
 <p class="caption">An illustrative range command, not a trace or a complete SQL transaction. Replica B is chosen as the first responding follower; no elapsed time is implied. A multi-range purchase still needs a transaction decision after its participant ranges do their work.</p>
</figure>
<script>
 import {stepper} from '../../figures/stepper.mjs';
 const root=document.querySelector('[data-r44-quorum]');
 if(root){const out=root.querySelector('[data-out]') as HTMLSelectElement;
 const player=stepper(root,{steps:()=>4,draw:(step)=>{
 const missing=Number(out.value),votes=step<2?0:3-missing,majority=votes>=2;
 root.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-replica]').forEach((el,i)=>{const absent=i>0&&i>=3-missing;el.classList.toggle('absent',absent);el.querySelector('[data-replica-status]').textContent=absent?'Unreachable':step>=2?'Proposal durable':step===1?'Proposal sent':'Waiting';el.querySelector('[data-log]').textContent=!absent&&step>=2?'Earlier log + command':'Earlier log';});
 root.querySelector('[data-count]').textContent=`${votes} of 3 votes · majority needs 2`;
 root.querySelector('[data-result]').textContent=step<3?'Command not yet committed':majority?'Range command committed':'No majority · command cannot commit';
 root.querySelector('[data-explanation]').textContent=[
 'The gateway has located the range. A has its lease; B and C hold voting copies of the same range.',
 'A proposes one command for this range. Its lease is authority to coordinate the request, rather than an extra vote.',
 majority?'At least two voting copies have persisted the proposal. Waiting for the third is unnecessary for this majority.':'Only A has persisted the proposal. A lease does not let one voter replace the missing majority.',
 majority?'The range command can commit. This says nothing by itself about the final outcome of a transaction involving other ranges.':'The range cannot safely accept this command. Putting a SQL gateway beside A does not supply the missing votes.'
 ][step];
 }});out.addEventListener('change',()=>player.render());}
</script>
<style>
.quorum{margin:2.5rem 0;font-family:var(--font-sans)}figcaption{font:1.25rem/1.4 var(--font-serif);margin-bottom:.9rem}figcaption>span{font:.75rem var(--font-sans);text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--color-text-secondary);margin-right:.5rem}.controls{padding:.8rem;background:var(--color-surface)}label{font:.85rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);display:grid;gap:.4rem}select,button{font:inherit;color:var(--color-text);background:var(--color-surface-alt);border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding:.55rem;max-width:100%}.scene{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary)}.gateway{font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);border-bottom:1px dashed var(--color-text-secondary);padding-bottom:1rem}.replicas{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.6rem}.replicas section{border:1px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.7rem}.replicas .panel-title{font:600 .9rem/1.4 var(--font-sans);margin:0}.replicas p,.log{font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.log{border-top:1px solid var(--color-text-secondary);padding-top:.5rem}.absent{border-style:dashed!important}.absent .log{text-decoration:line-through}.count{font:600 1.1rem/1.4 var(--font-sans)}[data-result]{font:.9rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);min-height:3em}[data-explanation]{font:.9rem/1.55 var(--font-sans);border-left:3px solid var(--color-accent);padding:.6rem .8rem;min-height:5em}.playback{display:flex;gap:.45rem;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;background:var(--color-surface);padding:.8rem}.playback button{cursor:pointer}.playback [aria-disabled=true]{opacity:.55}[data-hold]{height:3px;background:var(--color-surface)}[data-hold] span{height:3px;background:var(--color-accent);display:block;width:0}details,.caption{font:.8rem/1.5 var(--font-sans);margin-top:.9rem}.caption{color:var(--color-text-secondary)}@media(max-width:550px){.replicas{grid-template-columns:1fr}.replicas section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:4rem 1fr;gap:.4rem}.replicas p{margin:0}.log{grid-column:1/-1}}
</style>
